    },
    "text": "1. **Research for host agents.** A host asks Delphi to research a question. The answer comes back with cited claims, and what was learned is captured so the knowledge base grows and agents improve over time (§3-§6).\n2. **Identity in answers.** Every answer that Delphi produces says which role gave it, with the one-line badge and the coloured name with role in parentheses, as the console shows them (§7)."
  }
